# Ordruun Mentor's "whenever you attack a player, target creature that's
# attacking that player gains first strike": Mode$ AttackersDeclaredOneTarget
# records the attacked player (AbilityKey.AttackedTarget,
# TriggerAttackersDeclared.java:93-96), and the target restriction
# Creature.attacking TriggeredAttackedTarget reads it while the target is
# chosen, before the trigger resolves (CardProperty.java:1543-1549). The human
# Bears attack alone and are the target; with first strike they kill the
# blocking Bears before those deal damage back.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 2
queue targets 2
declareattackers
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks 3=2
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
